  "title": {
    "bn": "আমার নাম",
    "ko": "이름 말하기",
    "en": "My Name Is"
  },
  "description": {
    "bn": "প্রথম ব্যাকরণ: 'আমি ___' বলা শিখুন। এটাই লেসন ১-এর ভিত্তি।",
    "ko": "첫 문법: '저는 ~입니다'로 자기소개하기.",
    "en": "Your first grammar pattern: saying 'I am ___'. This is the foundation of Lesson 1."
  },
  "estimatedMinutes": 20,
  "requirements": {
    "requiredStepIds": [
      "mn-intro",
      "mn-copula",
      "mn-speak-model",
      "mn-question",
